{"repositoryId":1250321811,"availability":"available","full":"Servosity/msp-skills","name":"msp-skills","description":"Free MCP servers + Claude Code Skills for MSP tools - PSA, RMM, backup, M365. Local-first: your data never leaves your network.","category":"Productivity","language":"Go","stars":59,"forks":13,"created":"2026-05-26T14:14:21Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:18:45Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://msp-skills.compoundingteams.com","topics":["ai-agents","ai-for-msp","autotask","backup","claude-code","claude-mcp","claude-plugin","claude-skills","connectwise","datto","halopsa","m365","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","msp","msp-mcp","ninjaone","psa","rmm"],"demo":"https://msp-skills.compoundingteams.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:04.017Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:04.017Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:04.017Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:04.017Z","stars":59,"forks":13}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MSP Skills connects your PSA, RMM, backup, and more to the AI you already use - Claude, ChatGPT, Codex, Cursor, Windsurf, or any agent that speaks MCP. Ask a plain-English question about your stack and get a real answer back.","75 connectors are live today - including Servosity, ConnectWise PSA, HubSpot, and HaloPSA - and more PSA, RMM, backup, and M365 connectors ship every week.","Free, open source, runs on your laptop. A local SQLite mirror lets your agent answer cross-client questions the live API can't return in one shot - no rate-limit hits, no per-tech SaaS fee, and your data stays local unless you route it somewhere yourself. Built for MSP owners. No developer experience required."],"features":["Skill - a markdown file (and a binary it drives) that tells a Claude Code / Codex agent how to operate a specific tool. Think of it as a recipe card the AI reads on the fly.","MCP - Model Context Protocol. The open standard that lets AI apps (Claude Desktop, ChatGPT, Cursor, Windsurf, etc.) call tools on a separate server (yours).","MCP server - the small program on your machine that exposes the tools. Every MSP Skills connector ships one (e.g. halopsa-mcp, servosity-mcp).","PSA - Professional Services Automation. The system MSPs use for tickets, contracts, time, billing. HaloPSA, ConnectWise, Autotask are PSAs.","BCDR / Backup and DR - Business Continuity and Disaster Recovery. Servosity is a BCDR vendor."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Servosity/msp-skills/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"46fe3cbda676a5d168810d4050e1e85d6649b5242074da0c6fbbaac10c926e1c","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:04.462Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:04.462Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"MSP Skills connects your PSA, RMM, backup, and more to the AI you already use - Claude, ChatGPT, Codex, Cursor, Windsurf, or any agent that speaks MCP. Ask a plain-English question about your stack and get a real answer back.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Servosity/msp-skills/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Free, open source, runs on your laptop. A local SQLite mirror lets your agent answer cross-client questions the live API can't return in one shot - no rate-limit hits, no per-tech SaaS fee, and your data stays local unless you route it somewhere yourself. Built for MSP owners. No developer experience required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Servosity/msp-skills/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Servosity does not charge for API access required to run the Servosity skill.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Servosity/msp-skills/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"46fe3cbda676a5d168810d4050e1e85d6649b5242074da0c6fbbaac10c926e1c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Servosity/msp-skills/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:04.462Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T14:18:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":